TEXT -392 -440 Left 3 ;DC LOAD Rev E - ONE CURRENT-SINK CHANNEL - LOOP GAIN (Middlebrook voltage injection)
TEXT -392 -400 Left 1 ;Vinj breaks the loop between the source node (low Z, 0.1 R) and Rf (3.3k): ideal injection point.\nT(f) = -V(src)/V(inj).  In the log: PM = phase of V(src)/V(inj) at fc;  GM = -|V(src)/V(inj)| where its phase = 0.
TEXT 560 -200 Left 1 ;DUT model: supply + 20 mR lead +\nlead inductance (1 uH ~ 1 m of\nloose lead pair, 10 uH = abuse)
TEXT -392 360 Left 2 ;PASS criteria: PM >= 45 deg and GM >= 10 dB for every FET candidate, channel current\n50 mA ... 2.5 A and 1 ... 10 uH leads.  Rf=3.3k, Cc=1n, Rg=47 chosen from this sweep.
TEXT -392 460 Left 2 !.param fet=1 Ich=2.5 Llead=1u Vdut=24 Rs=0.1\n.step param fet list 1 2 3 4   ; 1 IRFP250N  2 IRFP240  3 IRF530  4 IXTH88N30P (big-die proxy)\n.step param Ich list 0.05 0.25 2.5\n.step param Llead list 1u 10u\n.ac dec 50 10 10Meg\n.meas AC fc WHEN mag(V(src)/V(inj))=1\n.meas AC PM FIND V(src)/V(inj) AT fc\n.meas AC GM FIND V(src)/V(inj) WHEN ph(V(src)/V(inj))=0\n.include ../../lib/fet_models.lib\n.include ../../lib/misc_models.lib\n.include ../../lib/tlv915x.lib\n
